    {
      "ja": "• ニッパーを使わず手でパチパチと簡単に外せるタッチゲート仕様。",
      "en": "• Touch gate design that allows you to easily remove it by hand without using nippers."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 可動域が広く、自由自在にポージングが決められる。",
      "en": "• Has a wide range of motion and can be posed freely."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ディテールの色分けも組み立てるだけで再現可能。",
      "en": "• Color-coding of details can also be reproduced using Assembly alone."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 左肩とシールドのエンブレムはマーキングシールで再現。",
      "en": "• The left shoulder and Seal emblem are reproduced with MarkingSeal."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「HGUC 1/144 RX-93νガンダム」（別売り）の武装を装備することが可能。",
      "en": "• Can be equipped with the armament of \"HGUC 1/144 RX-93νGundam\" (sold separately)."
